OL,3,GNEWSAAirport bosses back plans for
OL,4,Aparkway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FAirport bosses and West Yorkshire's
OL,7,Fmayor have backed calls for a proposed
OL,8,Frailway station at Leeds Bradford
OL,9,FAirport (LBA).
OL,11,FA report commissioned by the airport
OL,12,Fand published earlier claimed a new
OL,13,Fparkway station would be
OL,14,F"transformational for the region".
OL,16,FPlans for the railway station, which is
OL,17,Festimated to cost about #65m, were
OL,18,Ffirst mooted over a decade ago, and an
OL,19,Foutline business case was approved in
OL,20,F2020, but little progress has since
OL,21,Fbeen made.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
